msgid "Sell subscription products on your eCommerce"
msgstr "ຂາຍສິນຄ້າແບບສະໝັກສະມາຊິກໃນ eCommerce ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: website_sale_subscription
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_sale_subscription.product_template_message
msgid ""
"This subscription is not compatible with the one already in your cart.\n"
"                Please order them separately or empty your cart."
msgstr ""
"ການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກັບລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນກະຕ່າຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"                ກະລຸນາສັ່ງຊື້ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ລຶບລາຍການໃນກະຕ່າຂອງທ່ານອອກ."

#. module: website_sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_subscription/controllers/cart.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot add the subscription product '%s' to a cart that already contains "
"a one-time purchase.\n"
"Please order them separately or empty your cart."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າແບບສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ '%s' ເຂົ້າໃນກະຕ່າທີ່ມີ ການຊື້ແບບຄັ້ງດຽວຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້.\n"
"ກະລຸນາສັ່ງຊື້ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ລຶບລາຍການໃນກະຕ່າຂອງທ່ານອອກ."

#. module: website_sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_subscription/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot have an optional product that has a no common pricing's plan."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດມີສິນຄ້າທາງເລືອກທີ່ບໍ່ມີແຜນກຳນົດລາຄາຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. module: website_sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_subscription/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "You cannot mix different subscription plans in the same order."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຮວມແຜນສະໝັກສະມາຊິກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ດຽວກັນໄດ້."

